2026-07-27T10:04:35.6103876Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T10:04:35.6104239Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T10:04:35.6104799Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T10:04:35.6105860Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T10:04:35.6106983Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
